<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South African mother drowns baby in paint.</title>
<headline>South African mother drowns baby in paint.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South African woman has been arrested for murder after she drowned her new-born baby girl in a tin of paint, police said on Sunday.</p>
<p>A statement said the 20-year-old woman gave birth at the home of friends on Saturday and immediately placed the infant in a half-filled five-litre tin of paint.</p>
